OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fgenerally dry in the east overnight
OL,7,Fwith a patchy frost and the odd fog
OL,8,Fpatch. Elsewhere though it will be
OL,9,Fmilder and breezy, with thicker cloud
OL,10,Fand some rain edging in from the
OL,11,Fsouthwest.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FTuesday will be a rather
OL,14,Fcloudy and breezy day with outbreaks
OL,15,Fof rain spreading in across all areas
OL,16,Ffrom the southwest. One or two heavy
OL,17,Fbursts are possible in places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
